  "description": "IPOREO crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C42 H102 Cl6 Dy6 Ga7 N12 O60 3+,3(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.992-3.992 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.99-110.03°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C42H102Cl9Dy6Ga7N12O60. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
